OL,3,GNEWSAWoman arrested as man seriously
OL,4,Ahurt in dog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested after a man
OL,7,Fwas left with serious injuries after
OL,8,Fbeing attacked by a dog, police say.
OL,10,FThe 44-year-old victim was taken to
OL,11,Fhospital while a woman, 53, was
OL,12,Farrested on suspicion of owning a
OL,13,Fdangerously out of control dog.
OL,15,FSussex Police said it was called to
OL,16,FLangney Pond, in Sandpiper Walk in
OL,17,FEastbourne, at about 15:10 BST on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
