OL,4,Ahurt in dog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the animal, believed to
OL,7,Fbe a bull terrier and Doberman cross,
OL,8,Fhad been seized and that the victim and
OL,9,Fthe woman knew each other.
